{"c":[{"id":"bef068590e8abc34","sum":"Slice 2: an observed goal replays on recorded observations (goals/replay.ts), never the writer; mail list cells mint at their own node. Host auth: hostChallenge until hostProof (HMAC(secret,'caret-host-key')). #26: input on the target sets mayIncludeInput, Undo refuses.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1009588b28818d14","sum":"Slice 2: a goal that observed replays its program on recorded observations and choices (goals/replay.ts), never the writer. Mail windows are conversations (under half per request): mint list cells at their own node or a shared subject charges every row.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T182045Z-7e784e62f684bf75","text":"Slice 2 replay: goal programs are re-run on recorded observations/choices (goals/replay.ts); a goal that observed never calls the writer again, so fresh() returns null for it. Observation values come from a frozen copy obs<n>:<windowId> kept in GoalRuns.sourcesOf.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T182045Z-9c9e184e59259bec","text":"Mail windows are conversations (one request reveals under half): mint each list cell at its own node (wholePart(nodePart(key,'label'))), or a subject several rows share charges every row and the rows get cut.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"696261eff2d2443c","sum":"Host auth: host: true hello gets only hostChallenge until hostProof (key HMAC(secret,'caret-host-key')); tests: authenticateHost, Caret via CARET_HOST_KEY_FD. #26: reader fieldInput and page inputAt feed InputWatch; input on the target sets mayIncludeInput, Undo refuses.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T184417Z-0281f0608f009ca0","text":"Host auth: a host: true hello gets hostChallenge and nothing else until a valid hostProof (key = HMAC(launch secret,'caret-host-key')); helper tests give HelperServer a secret and call authenticateHost (test/socket-reader.ts); attached Caret is host only via CARET_HOST_KEY_FD.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T190928Z-cced71498674f91b","text":"Issue #26: reader fieldInput (keys but Esc, element from cached focus, none after Tab) and page PageControl.inputAt feed executor InputWatch from send time; input on the target makes the recovery read unknown and sets mayIncludeInput so Undo refuses.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b1cf0eff9f8fec1f","sum":"SC1: app exclusions in ExcludedApps.swift must match privacy/read-policy.ts; sc1-boundary scans fixtures/web-form, so JSON evidence uses writeStoreJson. No valid hostProof: status only (send-gate.ts). Page text controls send hasValue/rev, never value (test/page-wire.ts).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a304c2583e630fa2","sum":"Privacy parity tests: app exclusions live in CaretScreenCore/ExcludedApps.swift and helper/privacy/read-policy.ts (sc1-exclusions checks them); sc1-boundary also scans fixtures/web-form, so JSON evidence goes through writeStoreJson/appendStoreJson.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T221421Z-808e29cf46023ffd","text":"Required app exclusions live in CaretScreenCore/ExcludedApps.swift and helper/privacy/read-policy.ts; sc1-exclusions.test.ts checks parity, and DenyList.init/ScreenModel.setAppsOff union user additions without rewriting existing files.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261011T210733Z-f73884678039eb3c","text":"sc1-boundary.test.ts scans fixtures/web-form scripts too: write JSON evidence with writeStoreJson/appendStoreJson (privacy/send.ts); writeStore of JSON.stringify text fails the suite.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ab8af6774b62fa2","sum":"Oct 16: a consumer without a valid hostProof gets only status (send-gate.ts; tests prove the host via test/socket-reader.ts); page text controls send hasValue/rev, never value: tests build fields with test/page-wire.ts onWire, FakePage.write stands for Caret's write.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T081625Z-8018844f464b5458","text":"Helper socket (fix/nonhost-nothing): a consumer without a valid hostProof is sent only status (helper/src/send-gate.ts); a test or script that reads proposals, memory or activity must prove the host key (test/socket-reader.ts authenticateHost, launch_secret.host_proof).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T101345Z-9f17fb785cbb46ba","text":"Page text controls send hasValue/rev, never value (zod refuses one); test pages build fields with helper/test/page-wire.ts onWire, and FakePage.write stands for Caret's write landing so pageRestore has the page-held before.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
